PRODUCT: Linke Hofmann Busch (LHB) Authentic Rolling Stock Add-on
COMPATIBILITY: Open Rails Train Simulator 1.4+ / MSTS with MSTS Bin 1.8
LICENSE: End User License Agreement (Personal Simulation Use Only)

INSTALLATION INSTRUCTIONS:
1. Ensure your simulator has the base Indian Railways route / trainset installed.
2. Copy the coach directories into your simulator's TRAINS\TRAINSET folder.
3. Copy any included .con (consist) files into TRAINS\CONSISTS.
4. Launch Open Rails and select an activity or explore mode.

TECHNICAL HIGHLIGHTS:
- High-poly FIAT-SIG Bogies with disk brake calipers
- Authentic 3D Passenger interior with pushback seating
- Calibrated .wag physics parameters with realistic Davis drag
- Night illumination and dynamic lighting effects

